nothing does, so the result is the 0-array:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"9400e5d6-0061-c145-910d-3ad51eb7eddd"],

Cell["ArrayMultiply[{{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}}, \"i,i\"]", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"acc7a08b-6144-3840-928a-b820e2d4c989"],

